This program prints four lines. Write them in order, separated by commas (for example `a, b, c, d`).

```swift
final class Lamp {
    let id: Int
    init(_ id: Int) { self.id = id }
    deinit { print("off", id) }
}
var x: Lamp? = Lamp(1)
var y: Lamp? = Lamp(2)
var z = x
x = nil
print("after x")
y = nil
z = nil
print("end")
```

